{"3665010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bound Beyond", "steam_appid": 3665010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/b11700e92fcf2dcb7e1dd70bc7271c65.poster.avif?t=1781634447\" width=1170 height=2058 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/b11700e92fcf2dcb7e1dd70bc7271c65.webm?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/b11700e92fcf2dcb7e1dd70bc7271c65.mp4?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/31f6e424bd5cad03354438bdd14ec4dc.webp?t=1781634447\" width=798 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiera is a private investigator sent to look into the disappearance of the famous archaeologist Ashley Mane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This case is Kiera’s chance to escape routine work and prove she is capable of more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But behind the doors of the archeologist’s mansion she’ll find an ancient mystery that pulls her into dangerous, forgotten corners of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiera’s task is to survive, explore, and uncover the truth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with Kiera, you’ll uncover the truth, step by step — through environments, objects, symbols, artifacts and what’s left behind. But the investigation is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/d6dfe2f98789a89cf918af9e422877b2.poster.avif?t=1781634447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/d6dfe2f98789a89cf918af9e422877b2.webm?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/d6dfe2f98789a89cf918af9e422877b2.mp4?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/9d3be9d65d64dd5d01e860aca8f41410.webp?t=1781634447\" width=798 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment as a tool — or a weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragile or heavy — every object behaves differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break, move, and rearrange your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment, improvise, and find solutions that fit your approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, balance, and vault through vertical spaces </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/333b8112fce9acd0f6be121f2d2177d1.poster.avif?t=1781634447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/333b8112fce9acd0f6be121f2d2177d1.webm?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/333b8112fce9acd0f6be121f2d2177d1.mp4?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧩World-driven puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Puzzle Has a Reason</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random codes or abstract riddles - puzzles are the story part</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe your surroundings and connect the dots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient mechanisms and physical contraptions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🙋‍♀️You don’t just control Kiera — you inhabit her.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You control a body, not an interface. She Breathes. She Struggles. She Endures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Her state becomes part of the challenge. Pushing forward has consequences.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatigue and injury are visible and audible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear, stress, and exhaustion shape how she moves and responds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat, falls, and narrow escapes take a toll — there’s no instant reset.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/12a2fab67ecb626b02aad00f43230b77.webp?t=1781634447\" width=798 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/4c2dde672ea8119243f10330319a77cc.poster.avif?t=1781634447\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/4c2dde672ea8119243f10330319a77cc.webm?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/4c2dde672ea8119243f10330319a77cc.mp4?t=1781634447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are Being Hunted</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study enemy behavior and decide how to survive - hide, fight, or slip past unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find alternate routes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage: shadows, hiding spots, and terrain help you stay unseen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have tools to reveal hidden symbols, clues, traps and paths others would miss - UV light, a camera, and a flashlight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront danger head-on using whatever you can - modern, ancient weapons, or anything you can get your hands on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665010/extras/ffd1f183dd35c4419f2a235b51986d0b.webp?t=1781634447\" width=798 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOME MYSTERIES WERE NEVER MEANT TO BE SOLVED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a routine investigation turns into something far stranger, every clue brings you closer to a truth that should have stayed buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy dark detective stories, atmospheric exploration, and puzzles woven directly into the world — <strong>Bound Beyond</strong> is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your Steam Wishlist</strong> and be the first to step beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is currently in development. All showcased gameplay, visuals, and features represent a work in progress and are subject to change. Final content may differ from what is shown.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\